{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10113130","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10113130","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1011313001:0":{"text":"……婆婆，就像我们说的那样，不知道为什么，耀光的佣兵们似乎是在故意挑起我们和耀光之间的争端。","source_cn":"……婆婆，就像我们说的那样，不知道为什么，耀光的佣兵们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FF9CD5A4A0CE36E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1011313002:0":{"text":"而荆棘卫队也行踪诡秘。为了进一步激化矛盾，他们甚至一路追击达米安，将他逼进了迷宫里！","source_cn":"而荆棘卫队也行踪诡秘。为了进一步激化矛盾，他们甚至一路...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x290F1B90B3943CE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1011313003:0":{"text":"不仅如此，他们还试图将达米安的失踪嫁祸给耀光难民……要不是我们及时赶到，后果不堪设想。","source_cn":"不仅如此，他们还试图将达米安的失踪嫁祸给耀光难民……要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9581DA7ED20E05C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1011313004:0":{"text":"荆棘为什么会变成这样？他们固然保守，可怎么会突然变得如此极端？","source_cn":"荆棘为什么会变成这样？他们固然保守，可怎么会突然变得如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA20963D5BBE6DFF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1011313005:0":{"text":"伊米尔那老家伙，肯定是他授意！之前在贤者会议上，他听完荆棘卫队的报告后，态度很坚决。","source_cn":"伊米尔那老家伙，肯定是他授意！之前在贤者会议上，他听完...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA86DFD2D51C82B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_femal